{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Versioned immutable codec/quality profiles (spec 18.3). The CLI (anim_headless) and the",
    "WP10 editor select a profile by name; `anim_export::settings::validate` then checks the",
    "selection against the project and the 18.6 codec matrix and folds these fixed values into",
    "the settings_hash. Only the MP4/H.264 rows are certified on this pinned FFmpeg (WP09",
    "ruling, DECISIONS #50): the mov_prores4444 and png_sequence entries are defined so the",
    "file matches the full 18.6 matrix, but validate refuses them with CapabilityNotCertified",
    "because prores_ks / the .mov container / the alpha pix_fmt were never capability-probed.",
    "Values below for those rows are therefore descriptive, not exercised."
  ],
  "profiles": [
